WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:03.880
Your sister she was a good wife.

00:03.960 --> 00:05.280
Yes.

00:05.360 --> 00:09.573
For you she did what a wife should do.

00:19.240 --> 00:24.080
Your Majesty, rest assured I like my sister for Your Majesty.

00:24.160 --> 00:29.520
Will devote myself completely if Your Majesty has any orders just speak directly.

00:31.960 --> 00:35.000
Good then I'll speak directly.

00:45.160 --> 00:46.827
This is what Sheng'er wrote.

00:52.200 --> 00:54.867
Although there are still many areas needing improvement.

00:56.160 --> 01:01.880
But I think you can help him you're his uncle this matter.

01:01.960 --> 01:03.360
I only trust you.

01:06.520 --> 01:10.800
I hope you'll go to Qingzhou to organize reforms.

01:11.080 --> 01:15.920
Change the original land tax system from taxing by headcount to taxing by land.

01:16.400 --> 01:22.400
In this way those with more land will pay more tax those with less land can pay less tax.

01:23.080 --> 01:26.400
If the results are good then extend to the whole country.

01:27.240 --> 01:32.680
Qingzhou lady Chen's hometown what?

01:33.680 --> 01:38.560
It's fine Your Majesty, rest assured this matter I.

01:38.640 --> 01:40.400
Will do my utmost.

01:42.440 --> 01:43.840
Come, drink.

